# Interactive smoke: boot the bring-up firmware on the jess RT1176 platform.
#   renode hardware/renode/rt1176-smoke.resc
#
# Paths are $ORIGIN-relative (this script's own directory), so it runs from ANY working
# directory — inside the checkout or from an unpacked jess-renode-rt1176 release archive
# (jess#299). They used to be repo-root-relative and failed from anywhere else with
# "Could not find file 'hardware/renode/pixhawk6xrt.repl'". Note: NO `@` before $ORIGIN —
# Renode documents that, and `@$ORIGIN/...` is read as a literal path (measured: it fails).
using sysbus
mach create "pixhawk6xrt"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/pixhawk6xrt.repl
sysbus LoadELF $ORIGIN/smoke/rt1176-smoke.elf
showAnalyzer sysbus.lpuart1
start
